		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r23_boss_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶ　とは
ポケモンを　きずつけること……▼
そうとらえ　きらっていたが
そんな　たんじゅんな　ものでは　ない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T05:49:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-13T11:14:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負　とは
ポケモンを　傷つけること……▼
そうとらえ　忌避　していたが
そんな　単純な　ものでは　ない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T05:49:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-13T11:14:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・首フリ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T05:51:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-13T11:14:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#408080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r23_boss_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　ヒト
なぜ　わかたれることなく
ともに　くらし
ともに　たたかうのか……！▼
それは　ちいさいけれども
おなじ　こんなんに　いどむ～
それこそが～
こうしき　かい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T05:55:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T12:15:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data
・手持ちにＮポケモンがいる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T12:15:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
